# Agent Test Toolkit has no translated strings.
#
# Every message it produces is either a log record with a fixed English field
# vocabulary, which must not vary by locale because it is parsed, or a chat
# reply prefixed [DevToolkit]. Forge still asks for this file and warns when it
# is absent, so it exists to keep the toolkit from adding noise about itself to
# the log it is meant to make trustworthy.
